{"unit_id":"Zhucy123__dsh-update#card-zh","repo":"Zhucy123/dsh-update","commit":"1519ee6dc5df45eee099ee090748342c43d3f396","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-update 是面向 DSH Web 的更新插件，在侧边栏底部提供更新入口，并由服务端注册状态查询、更新、发布说明和重启接口。它比较本地 deepseek-harness checkout 与 GitHub 上的 dsh-v* 标签，展示版本和发布说明；用户确认后可更新或回退，流程包含暂存本地改动、检出标签、安装依赖、清理和构建，并通过事件流显示进度。更新后可重启并检查启动日志，失败时尝试恢复原版本。适合希望从 Web 界面管理 DSH 版本的使用者。需要本地 DSH 仓库、Git、pnpm（部分环境可用 corepack）及 GitHub 网络连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:998","lib/index.js:1827","lib/index.js:1953","lib/index.js:1102"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhucy123__dsh-update#card-en","repo":"Zhucy123/dsh-update","commit":"1519ee6dc5df45eee099ee090748342c43d3f396","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-update adds a DSH Web sidebar panel to compare local and GitHub versions, read release notes, and update or roll back a checkout after confirmation. It streams progress through install and build, then can restart DSH and check startup logs.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:998","lib/index.js:1827","lib/index.js:1953","lib/index.js:1102"]}
